# NixOS
.direnv/

# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Generated dependency and linked-worktree directories
vendor/
/worktree/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Dolt database files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db

# Immutable test fixtures are the one exception to the *.db rule above: these
# bytes are checked-in source data, not a runtime database.
!testdata/dbos/*.db
